        ],
        "description": "<p>XFreeRDP-GUI is a lightweight graphical interface for XFreeRDP on Linux. It simplifies Remote Desktop Protocol (RDP) connections by allowing users to connect to remote systems without manually entering command-line options.</p><p></p><p>Key features include:</p><ul><li><p>Easy-to-use graphical interface.</p></li><li><p>Save and manage RDP connections.</p></li><li><p>Access previously saved connections.</p></li><li><p>Quickly reconnect to recent or latest sessions.</p></li><li><p>Simple installation and uninstallation scripts.</p></li></ul><p></p><p>It uses Zenity and AWK and works alongside XFreeRDP rather than replacing it.</p>",
        "previewImage": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nightmaregaurav-lab/portfolio/main/public/uploads/Screenshot from 2024-02-09 20-47-34.png",
